356	     * Whether this owner belongs to the same household as {@code other}: that is, they
357	     * share the same last name and postcode. The last name is compared
358	     * case-insensitively with runs of whitespace collapsed to a single space (and
359	     * surrounding whitespace trimmed); the postcode is compared for exact equality (two
360	     * absent postcodes count as equal). Owners in the same household resolve to the same
361	     * {@link #computeHouseholdId() household identifier}.
362	     *
363	     * @param other the owner to compare against
364	     * @return {@code true} if both owners share a household
365	     */
